==Ranks==
Players can reach different ranks by filling in certain amounts of collection log slots, which allow players to claim the corresponding staff of collection from [[The Collector]].

The staves also come with a "Create-book" option, which produces an equipable copy for the offhand slot.

It's possible to claim staves on a free-to-play world, but it is still an unusable members' object. However, the equippable books are free-to-play objects, even if they have to first be created on a members world using the corresponding staff.

