==Changes==
{{Subject changes header}}
{{Subject changes
|date = 25 February 2026
|update = Cow Boss is Out Today!
|change = Your personal best time for the Shellbane Gryphon is now shown in the collection log.
}}
{{Subject changes
|date = 17 December 2025
|update = More Sailing and Interface Changes
|change = 
* Bosses who have their kill times tracked have had a 'Personal Best' section added at the top of their respective Collection Log entry.
* The Shellbane gryphon collection log now lists the pet first, inline with other collection logs.
}}
{{Subject changes
|date = 10 December 2025
|update = Christmas Event 2025
|change = The Collection Log now updates correctly when receiving [[Dragon Cannonballs]] from sorting [[Opulent Salvage]].
}}
{{Subject changes
|date = 26 November 2025
|update = Sailing: Week One Feedback & Fixes
|change = The Collection Log buttons for the [[Shellbane Gryphon]] and [[Scurrius]] now open the correct entries.
}}
{{Subject changes
|date = 11 June 2025
|update = Misc Galore & Yama Tweaks
|change = Players can open the Collection Log and Combat Achievement interfaces at the same time.
}}
{{Subject changes
|date = 29 May 2025
|update = Yama CAs & More!
|change = 
* The collection log now displays the correct [[dossier]] icon.
* [[Oathplate shards]] now appear in the Yama collection log entry.
* The [[dragon chainbody]] has been removed from the Yama collection log.
}}
{{Subject changes
|date = 9 April 2025
|update = Farming & Autocast QoL Improvements
|change = The collection log is now in the hiscores panel in the sidebar.
}}
{{Subject changes
|date = 5 March 2025
|update = Game Jam: Charges QoL
|change = Fixed an issue where certain ornament kits, painted items, and upgrade attachments were not correctly unlocking in the Collection Log for Iron players.
}}
{{Subject changes
|date = 5 February 2025
|update = Royal Titans
|change = More items have been added to the collection log [[ironman]] whitelist, including the [[Swift blade]], [[fedora]], [[partyhat & specs]], [[amulet of rancour]], and [[pharaoh's sceptre]].
}}
{{Subject changes
|date = 29 January 2025
|update = Bounty Hunter Changes, Collection Log Updates & Emote Improvements
|poll = Summer Summit 2024 - Summary
|change =
* An overview section has been added to the log's interface.
* A ranking system has been added.
* [[Staves of collection]] have been added as a reward for reaching certain collection ranks.
* The log's interface is now resizable and movable.
* [[Ironmen]] can now have drops obtained before the collection log's introduction used on it to retroactively fill in the slots for those items.
* The collection log item can now be wielded.
}}
{{Subject changes
|date = 23 October 2024
|update = Halloween Fixes & Miscellaneous Changes
|change = Clicking [[Vorkath]]'s collection log link no longer directs players to [[The Whisperer]]’s page.
}}
{{Subject changes
|date = 6 March 2024
|update = Miscellaneous Quality of Life Changes
|change = * Search result categories can now be clicked to view additional information for the entire category.
* Search result category names can now be clicked to navigate to the main page for the category.
}}
{{Subject changes
|date = 16 August 2023
|update = Desert Treasure II Changes & More
|change = *Fixed a bug where certain items were being skipped or displaying incorrectly in the collection log. Players affected by this issue should find the issues resolved upon their next log in.
*Fixed a bug with collection log values related to Larran's big chest, the Brimstone chest, and the Gauntlet.
}}
{{Subject changes
|date = 3 August 2023
|update = Desert Treasure II - Tweaks and Drop Rates
|change = [[Duke Sucellus]], [[The Leviathan]], [[The Whisperer]] and [[Vardorvis]] had the [[Awakener's orb]] added to their collection log.
}}
{{Subject changes
|date = 26 July 2023
|update = Desert Treasure II - The Fallen Empire
|change = The following bosses from [[Desert Treasure II - The Fallen Empire|Desert Treasure II]] were added to the collection log:
* [[Duke Sucellus]]
* [[The Leviathan]]
* [[The Whisperer]]
* [[Vardorvis]]
}}
{{Subject changes
|date = 12 July 2023
|update = Forestry: Part One - Further Changes
|change = * The collection log for [[Forestry]] now includes the [[lumberjack outfit]].
* Forestry is now in the correct alphabetical position in the Other section of the collection log, rather than the very bottom.
}}
{{Subject changes
|date = 5 July 2023
|update = Forestry: Part One - Feedback Changes
|change = Rewards received from [[Forestry]] now appear in the collection log.
}}
{{Subject changes
|date = 29 June 2022
|update = Unranked Group Iron Changes and More!
|change = The Combat Achievement button in the collection log is now in the same place no matter which category is selected.
}}
{{Subject changes
|date = 4 May 2022
|update = Guardians of the Rift & Beneath Cursed Sands Changes
|change = Added the Tarnished Locket and the Lost Bag to the collection log. They will retroactively unlock for anyone who's already received them as drops.
}}
{{Subject changes
|date = 12 January 2022
|update = Nex Changes & Tweaks
|change = Nexling now correctly shows up in the collection log.
}}
{{Subject changes
|date = 17 November 2021
|update = Duel Arena Changes
|change = The collection log entry for Penance Gloves will now update on login and when opening the Log.
}}
{{Subject changes
|date = 28 April 2021
|update = Arceuus Spellbook Beta and A Kingdom Divided Preparation
|change = Some new counters have been added to the collection log, including the number of Tempoross Reward Permits claimed, and Spoils Of War opened in Soul Wars!
}}
{{Subject changes
|date = 14 April 2021
|update = Below Ice Mountain
|change = *Brimhaven graceful pieces will now be correctly counted within the collection log on log-in.
*Players can now search for all boss categories in the collection log.
}}
{{Subject changes
|date = 7 April 2021
|update = Collection Log Improvements and The Last of Poll 74
|change = *The collection log now has a search function.
*A new counter shows the total number of unique items obtained.
*Added a toggleable chat/popup notification when a new item has been added to the collection log.
*The colour of each section of the log changes based on its completed status.
*Different boss modes now have separate kill counts on their respective interfaces (Dagannoth Kings, Gauntlet, Chambers of Xeric).
*Gnome Restaurant has a delivery count at the top of its section.
*Volcanic Mine rewards have been added.
*Third age and gilded items can now be found in the "Rares" tabs for each clue scroll.
*A Brimhaven Agility section has been added to the minigames tab.
