*"droprate" is a reference to a meme within the community that implies all [[drop rate]]s in-game are actually 50:50, as you either get the drop or don't get the drop.
*"elf ears" is likely a reference to a request to add pointy ears (like those seen on elves) as a reward for completing [[Song of the Elves]].
* Despite [[Jad slippers]] being added to the game as a reward from the [[2023 Birthday event]], the search text has not been updated to indicate so.
*"monkfish" is a reference to a common misconception that [[monkfish]] are fictitious creatures made up specifically for ''RuneScape''. In reality, monkfish are part of the genus {{WP|Lophius}}, and are a species of {{WP|anglerfish}}.
*"you not lucky" is a reference to [[Transcript:TzHaar-Mej-Jal#Standard dialogue|the line]] said by [[TzHaar-Mej-Jal]] when unsuccessfully gambling a [[fire cape]] for the chance of obtaining the [[Tzrek-jad]] pet.
*As the complete collection log message implies ("Wait, you're not actually supposed to complete the log."), it is generally agreed to be virtually impossible for any one player to complete the entire collection log in a single lifetime. Nobody is known to have done so and given the extremely low drop rates of certain items (e.g. 3rd age equipment) it is unlikely the feat will ever be accomplished.

